        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Can be informed by the FIPS standard if employed. An impact rating is normally associated to assets as part of this standard. Worth talking to the Disaster recovery side of the business to identify any standards employed which can inform these metrics.</rdfs:comment>
